                                                "sense_id": "bc4a9faa-a65b-3c90-b32e-13978b9c295f",
                                                "text": "Other far-right sites would gravitate to Epik. Among the first to announce its migration in early 2019 was BitChute, a YouTube imitator that had been blocked by PayPal."
